            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Song</code> sınıfı için <code>name</code> ve <code>artist</code> alan bir constructor oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Song\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, artist)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.artist = artist\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"__int__\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Self\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>def</code>, ardından <code>__init__</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>self</code>, <code>artist</code>, <code>)</code> ve son olarak <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
